## Key Modules Implemented & Integrated

### 1. Distributed Correlation IDs (`X-Correlation-ID`)
- **[correlation.middleware.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/correlation.middleware.js)**: Mounted first in Express to extract or generate unique tracking tokens (`FF-YYYYMMDD-<uuid8>`).
- **[correlation.middleware.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/correlation.middleware.md)**: Data flow and architectural documentation.
- Attached to all outgoing HTTP headers, structured logs, error responses, database audit logs, and frontend Axios requests.

### 2. Structured JSON Logging & Observability
- **[logger.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/utils/logger.js)**: Structured logger supporting `INFO`, `WARN`, `ERROR`, `DEBUG` levels with contextual metadata.
- **[requestLogger.middleware.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/requestLogger.middleware.js)**: Captures exact endpoint latency (`durationMs`), status codes, user IDs, and client IPs using `res.on('finish')`.
- **[logger.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/utils/logger.md)** & **[requestLogger.middleware.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/requestLogger.middleware.md)**: Architectural documentation and mentor questions.

### 3. Granular Permission-Based Access Control (PBAC)
- **[permissions.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/config/permissions.js)**: Fine-grained capabilities matrix (`CASE_APPROVE`, `PAYMENT_CREATE`, `AI_ACTION_CONFIRM`, `AGENT_RUN`, `AUDIT_VIEW`, `SETTINGS_UPDATE`, etc.) mapped across system roles.
- **[permission.middleware.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/permission.middleware.js)**: Middleware guard verifying granular permissions, returning informative 403 Forbidden with exact required permissions if unauthorized.
- **[permissions.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/config/permissions.md)** & **[permission.middleware.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/permission.middleware.md)**: Specification and interview question guide.

### 4. Financial Transaction Safety & Idempotency Layer
- **[004_phase4_enterprise.sql](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/database/migrations/004_phase4_enterprise.sql)**: Database migration adding the `idempotency_keys` table.
- **[idempotency.model.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/models/idempotency.model.js)**: Repository for atomic lock creation and response caching.
- **[idempotency.middleware.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/idempotency.middleware.js)**: Enforces replay caching on `POST`, `PUT`, `PATCH`, `DELETE` operations with SHA-256 payload tamper verification.
- **[idempotency_keys.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/database/documentation/idempotency_keys.md)** & **[idempotency.middleware.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/middleware/idempotency.middleware.md)**: Complete lifecycle and ACID documentation.

### 5. Database Optimization & Standardized Pagination
- **[paginationHelper.js](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/utils/paginationHelper.js)**: SQL-injection-safe pagination and sorting parser (`page`, `limit <= 100`, `sortBy`, `order`), returning `{ data: [...], pagination: { page, limit, totalRecords, totalPages, hasNext, hasPrev } }`.
- **Compound B-Tree Indexes**: Created on `audit_logs(correlation_id)`, `payments(status, created_at)`, and `reconciliation_cases(status, priority, created_at)`.
- **[paginationHelper.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/backend/src/utils/paginationHelper.md)** & **[phase4_enterprise_indexes.md](file:///C:/Users/yuvan/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Finance-Flow-Agent/database/documentation/phase4_enterprise_indexes.md)**: Performance specification guides.

